{"lines":[{"h":0.016647113075137443,"y":0.041821792284265968,"c":1,"w":0.12054210662841797,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.087301762115640003},{"c":1,"h":0.011627906728013615,"x":0.087378641682977265,"y":0.093023255792969994,"w":0.038834950129191081,"t":"MAN:"},{"c":1,"w":0.04660194079081216,"t":"SADIE:","h":0.011627906728013615,"y":0.10901162788599317,"x":0.089320389216244397},{"h":0.011627906728013615,"t":"MAN:","x":0.087378641555901831,"y":0.15843023259944833,"w":0.036893202463785801,"c":1},{"x":0.089320389216244397,"w":0.04660194079081216,"t":"SADIE:","y":0.17441860485562333,"h":0.010174417941369751,"c":1},{"x":0.089227788822448348,"t":"MAN.","y":0.1916489388838476,"h":0.009143982646621196,"c":1,"w":0.035136655171712244},{"h":0.010174417941369751,"c":1,"x":0.089320389216244397,"y":0.20639534904166978,"w":0.04660194079081216,"t":"SADIE:"},{"t":"MAN:","w":0.036893202463785801,"y":0.23982558148337696,"h":0.011627906728013615,"x":0.08737864140767021,"c":1},{"w":0.04854368845621744,"t":"SADIE:","h":0.01308139551465759,"y":0.25436046490255493,"c":1,"x":0.087378641500046636},{"h":0.012609444971767858,"c":1,"x":0.087124571725347197,"t":"MAN:","w":0.039343090057373034,"y":0.28729992853781861},{"t":"OK, thanks. So now I'd like to ask you about your car use.","h":0.01466076218079182,"x":0.18446601779883867,"y":0.091569767147323122,"w":0.46213592529296876,"c":1},{"t":"Well, I have got a car but I don't use it that often. Mainly just to go to the","y":0.10747663544236796,"w":0.56893203735351561,"x":0.18446602005939694,"h":0.014641744548286595,"c":1},{"t":"supermarket. But that's about it really. My husband uses it at the weekends to go","x":0.18446602482281624,"y":0.12354651171954367,"w":0.63883494059244794,"h":0.016017351120803269,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883112922281,"w":0.12621359507242838,"c":1,"y":0.14098837238511341,"x":0.1825242703246803,"t":"to the golf club."},{"c":1,"y":0.1569767438890689,"t":"And what about a bicycle?","w":0.21165047963460284,"h":0.014674346543546823,"x":0.18446602222153349},{"x":0.182524273598169,"y":0.17289719654738178,"w":0.32233009338378904,"h":0.014641744548286595,"c":1,"t":"I don't actually have one at the moment."},{"y":0.18895348807912293,"t":"What about the city bikes you can rent? Do you ever use those?","w":0.50873784383138021,"h":0.014534884301301454,"c":1,"x":0.18446602944390519},{"x":0.18446602475141521,"w":0.63883494059244783,"h":0.014684308132278612,"c":1,"y":0.20494186017267368,"t":"No - I'm not keen on cycling there because of all the pollution. But I would like to"},{"w":0.41553398132324226,"h":0.016199376947040545,"x":0.18446601896000051,"c":1,"t":"get a bike - it would be good to use it to get to work.","y":0.22087227420807276},{"y":0.23681975875348127,"h":0.017055904828128021,"t":"So why haven't you got one now?","w":0.27594342549641926,"x":0.1843627910973771,"c":1},{"x":0.18446603514160151,"y":0.25290697664105988,"w":0.6097087097167968,"c":1,"h":0.015988371899566256,"t":"Well, I live in a flat - on the second floor and it doesn't have any storage - so"},{"w":0.3708737945556641,"y":0.27034883733036419,"x":0.18640776282422006,"t":"we'd have to leave it in the hall outside the flat.","h":0.011627906728013615,"c":1},{"x":0.18252427161653487,"c":1,"t":"I see. OK. Well, I think that's all...","y":0.28629283471889999,"w":0.27184466044108069,"h":0.016032746573474865},{"c":1,"w":0.10490637461344401,"t":"PART 2","x":0.089294385411776839,"y":0.3356682130460269,"h":0.017617062244831172},{"t":"Good evening, everyone. Let me start by welcoming you all to this talk and thanking you for","x":0.089320385287427556,"y":0.36760124610392797,"w":0.72427185058593746,"h":0.014666196044731628,"c":1},{"y":0.3837209299397677,"w":0.7262135823567708,"c":1,"x":0.087378645590936319,"h":0.014534884301301565,"t":"taking the time to consider joining ACE voluntary organisation. ACE offers support to people"},{"t":"and services in the local area and we're now looking for more volunteers to help us do this.","y":0.39968847330970014,"x":0.089320394970056144,"h":0.014641744548286595,"w":0.72038833618164055,"c":1},{"x":0.087378650059407426,"h":0.014654423366083136,"c":1,"y":0.42429906529422601,"t":"By the way, I hope you're all comfortable - we have brought in extra seats so that no one has","w":0.73980580647786454},{"w":0.71067962646484373,"h":0.014534884301301454,"c":1,"x":0.087378633279721313,"t":"to stand, but it does mean that the people at the back of the room may be a bit squashed.","y":0.44040697645181803},{"y":0.45638629288706589,"w":0.51067962646484366,"x":0.089320380844119043,"c":1,"t":"We'll only be here for about half an hour so, hopefully, that's OK.","h":0.015997427943339693},{"w":0.70097086588541668,"y":0.48099688448443623,"h":0.014642650687434533,"x":0.089320392201834881,"c":1,"t":"One of the first questions we're often asked is how old you need to be to volunteer. Well,"},{"x":0.087378651818890207,"t":"you can be as young as 16 or you can be 60 or over; it all depends on what type of voluntary","h":0.014534884301301565,"w":0.73398056030273429,"y":0.49709302296274438,"c":1},{"w":0.71262135823567707,"y":0.513081395443301,"h":0.015988371899566256,"x":0.087378641176723976,"t":"work you want to do. Other considerations, such as reliability, are crucial in voluntary work","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.5289719623490452,"x":0.089320388630469358,"w":0.38446601867675778,"t":"and age isn't related to these, in our experience.","h":0.014641744548286595},{"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"Another question we get asked relates to training. Well, there's plenty of that and it's all","y":0.55232558129222276,"w":0.68932037353515629,"c":1,"x":0.087378651606208183},{"h":0.015988371899566256,"t":"face-to-face. What's more, training doesn't end when you start working for us - it takes place","y":0.56976744195479301,"x":0.08737865179475364,"w":0.73398056030273429,"c":1},{"x":0.087378649063902095,"t":"before, during and after periods of work. Often, it's run by other experienced volunteers as","w":0.71456309000651042,"h":0.016199376947040545,"y":0.58566978192891828,"c":1},{"w":0.40970873514811201,"x":0.087378641416235331,"t":"managers tend to prefer to get on with other things.","h":0.016012823396011289,"c":1,"y":0.60174418598335644},{"y":0.62645348807992174,"c":1,"t":"Now, I would ask you to consider a couple of important issues before you decide to apply for","h":0.014668007134648553,"w":0.73009709676106771,"x":0.089320383559622102},{"x":0.087378649245024559,"t":"voluntary work. We don't worry about why you want to be a volunteer - people have many","h":0.016199376947040545,"y":0.64236760111397928,"c":1,"w":0.71456309000651042},{"h":0.014641744548286595,"w":0.70485438028971348,"c":1,"x":0.087378634999686441,"t":"different reasons that range from getting work experience to just doing something they've","y":0.65981308397193006},{"t":"always wanted to do. But it is critical that you have enough hours in the day for whatever role","y":0.67384032378985059,"x":0.087323374940216261,"w":0.73603073120117191,"h":0.016689445519373014,"c":1},{"t":"we agree is suitable for you - if being a volunteer becomes stressful then it's best not to do it","y":0.68971214835625783,"x":0.089262079946639025,"w":0.73216557820638017,"h":0.016198629456517066,"c":1},{"x":0.087378635986393366,"y":0.70778816183962368,"w":0.73009709676106771,"c":1,"h":0.014641744548286595,"t":"at all. You may think that your income is important, but we don't ask about that. It's up to you"},{"t":"to decide if you can work without earning money. What we value is dedication. Some of our","x":0.085436890140117044,"w":0.72427185058593757,"c":1,"y":0.72383720901010429,"h":0.014534884301301454},{"w":0.73990117390950527,"t":"most loyal volunteers earn very little themselves but still give their full energy to the work they","c":1,"y":0.73826680410033008,"x":0.087333896348065237,"h":0.017572402954101562},{"x":0.087247588509288404,"w":0.089680728912353513,"h":0.013258940557081766,"y":0.75643467483435034,"c":1,"t":"do with us."},{"c":1,"t":"OK, so let's take a look at some of the work areas that we need volunteers for and the sort of","w":0.73592234293619785,"x":0.089320381833128695,"y":0.802180685591245,"h":0.014679779813297156},{"y":0.81702213572513194,"w":0.28378270467122396,"h":0.017337772927923045,"t":"things that would help you in those.","x":0.087241404751503826,"c":1},{"y":0.8429906541206269,"h":0.014641744548286706,"w":0.71456309000651042,"c":1,"x":0.087378649070265713,"t":"You may wish simply to help us raise money. If you have the creativity to come up with an"},{"c":1,"y":0.85755817952704871,"t":"imaginative or novel way of fundraising, we'd be delighted, as standing in the local streets or","h":0.017550248000480662,"x":0.087316177668729344,"w":0.73216430664062504},{"x":0.087378653004359652,"y":0.87500000012231793,"w":0.38640775044759113,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"t":"shops with a collection box can be rather boring!"},{"h":0.014641744548286595,"c":1,"t":"One outdoor activity that we need volunteers for is litter collection and for this it's useful if you","x":0.089320389729316121,"y":0.89968847331097168,"w":0.7378640747070313},{"t":"can walk for long periods, sometimes uphill. Some of our regular collectors are quite elderly,","x":0.087335491486548067,"y":0.91395450523639743,"w":0.72826828002929689,"h":0.017750540997751751,"c":1},{"w":0.41175023396809896,"x":0.089263658293261341,"y":0.93165093965573498,"h":0.015395393252744083,"t":"but very active and keen to protect the environment.","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"100","x":0.089320388956888097,"y":0.959302325462148,"w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.01308139551465759},{"c":1,"w":0.02718446731567381,"x":0.85436893130108771,"y":0.12354651149468376,"h":0.013081395514657479,"t":"Q8"},{"x":0.85436893129361935,"t":"Q9","y":0.20494186032770034,"w":0.027184467315673921,"h":0.013081395514657479,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.01308139551465759,"y":0.25290697662039641,"t":"Q10","w":0.036893202463785801,"x":0.85048543751203909},{"y":0.42237369699657912,"x":0.85325386519468605,"c":1,"t":"Q11","w":0.037369070053100528,"h":0.015948275985004812},{"h":0.01453488311292217,"y":0.49563953500603897,"c":1,"x":0.85825242811276747,"w":0.036893202463785801,"t":"Q12"},{"t":"Q13","c":1,"w":0.036893202463785801,"y":0.56831395361069004,"h":0.01453488311292217,"x":0.8563106799574276},{"y":0.67410388251475217,"w":0.064302959442138596,"c":1,"t":"Q14\/15","h":0.013710839577553147,"x":0.85231453959969794},{"t":"Q14\/15","y":0.72238372079281643,"c":1,"h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.85242718458438016,"w":0.064077669779459612},{"t":"Q16","x":0.85242718503249193,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"w":0.038834950129191137,"y":0.84302325569470604},{"w":0.038834950129191137,"t":"Q17","x":0.85242718509427462,"y":0.89825581419142475,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3209}